            "vermeil_text": "Vermeil",
            "content1": "<p>MARCO DAL MASO vermeil is made with 18K gold over solid sterling silver, with a gold layer at least 2.5 microns thick.</p><p><strong>Care Tips:</strong></p><ul><li>Avoid contact with perfume, lotions, water, and chemicals.</li><li>Remove before swimming, bathing, and sleeping.</li><li>Store separately in a dry, soft-lined box and clean gently with a soft microfiber cloth. Do not use a silver polishing cloth.</li></ul><p>As with all gold-plated jewelry, the gold layer may gradually wear over time.<br/>Explore our Jewelry Care & Repair guide <a href=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/pages/support-center#product-care\" title=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/pages/support-center#product-care\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.&nbsp;</p>",
            "diamonds_text": "Lab grown diamonds",
            "content2": "<p>Discover our commitment to sustainability with lab-grown diamonds. These exquisite gems are created in controlled environments, offering the same brilliance as natural diamonds but with minimal environmental impact. Wear your values with pride.</p>",
            "pearls_text": "Natural Pearls",
            "content3": "<p>Discover the allure of nature with our authentic natural pearls. These oceanic gems, formed over time, exude classic charm. Each pearl carries a unique story, symbolising timeless elegance. Explore our products adorned with these treasures and experience their enduring beauty.</p>",
            "leather_text": "Vegan Leather",
            "content4": "<p>Experience the beauty of conscious choices with our vegan leather products. Crafted without animal materials, they're a statement of sustainable style. Discover durability and fashion, cruelty-free. Explore our range and embrace ethical elegance.</p>"
          }
        },
